---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    background: "#ffffff"
    primaryColor: "#f8fafc"
    primaryTextColor: "#111827"
    primaryBorderColor: "#334155"
    lineColor: "#475569"
    secondaryColor: "#fef3c7"
    tertiaryColor: "#dbeafe"
    fontFamily: "Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, sans-serif"
---
flowchart TD
    Start(["/chronos starts or resumes"]):::start --> Heartbeat["Machine heartbeat<br/>/goal, Stop hook, or notify"]:::engine
    Heartbeat --> Read["READ<br/>restore state before every cycle"]:::cycle

    State[("Audit log<br/>docs/chronos/chronos-log.md")]:::state
    State -.-> Read

    Read --> Select{"Any actionable issue?"}:::decision
    Select -->|yes| Find["FIND<br/>choose highest-value issue"]:::cycle
    Select -->|only parked| Complete(["Chronos Complete<br/>decision briefs attached"]):::done

    Find --> Fix["FIX<br/>reproduce, root-cause, patch"]:::cycle
    Fix --> Verify["VERIFY<br/>run objective checks"]:::verify
    Verify --> Result{"Outcome"}:::decision

    Result -->|pass| LogDone["LOG<br/>done evidence"]:::log
    Result -->|fixable failure| Fix
    Result -->|valid park reason| Brief["Owner Decision Brief<br/>evidence, trade-offs, recommendation"]:::brief
    Result -->|false promise or no marker| Reject["Hook rejects completion<br/>re-inject next cycle"]:::guard

    Brief --> Park["PARK<br/>do not block the queue"]:::park
    Park --> LogPark["LOG<br/>park reason and progress"]:::log

    LogDone --> State
    LogPark --> State
    LogDone --> Heartbeat
    LogPark --> Heartbeat
    Reject --> Heartbeat

    classDef start fill:#ecfeff,stroke:#0891b2,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a
    classDef engine fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#4f46e5,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef state fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#334155,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef cycle fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef verify fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef decision fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef brief fill:#fae8ff,stroke:#a21caf,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef park fill:#ffedd5,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef guard fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef log fill:#e2e8f0,stroke:#475569,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef done fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#15803d,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
